# The Princess Takes Flight. Turn 3 Bot1 casts it (lore 1): chapter I exiles Bot2's Ornithopter (up to one target creature, any
# controller). Turn 4 Bot2 casts a second Ornithopter. Turn 5, chapter II: Bot2's Ornithopter is no legal target ("target creature
# you control"), so Bot1's Memnite becomes a 3/3 flyer until end of turn (a 1/1 again on turn 7). Turn 7, chapter III returns the
# exiled Ornithopter under its owner's control (Bot2 has two again) and the Saga is sacrificed after III.

